    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The University of Alberta has awarded honorary doctor of science degrees to AKU President Firoz Rasul and Dr Saida Rasul at its convocation. The honorary degree from the University recognises outstanding Canadians who have strived to raise the standard of living of future generations.",
